            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gryphon-shriek-2.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "human-female-hit-3.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Gryphon-A",
            type: "Gryphon",
            side: 1,
            x: 12,
            y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon-A",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Gryphon_Tender",
            type: "Elvish Shaman",
            side: 1,
            x: 13,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon_Tender",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gryphon Tender",
            text: _("I am sorry, Prince Konrad. The young gryphons are breaking their ropes. They are simply getting too large and too restless to restrain anymore!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon-A",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Gryphon-B",
            type: "Gryphon",
            side: 1,
            x: 14,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon-B",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gryphon-hit-3.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("What’s this? Gryphons in my castle? Remove the beasts!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Beasts? We were planning to use them as mounts."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Ha ha! Gryphons as mounts! Is there no end to your folly?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("(looks miffed)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Well, if you must go on with this mad scheme, I shall supply you with my own troops as riders! A frail human — or worse, an elf — would never be able to handle their violent instincts!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("(looks miffed)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Temper your anger. Lord Relgorn’s manner may be rough, but surely there is nothing wrong with his suggestion?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Well, I suppose..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "rider",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon-B",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Mounted_Dwarf",
            type: "Gryphon Rider",
            side: 1,
            x: 14,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Mounted_Dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mounted Dwarf",
            text: _("Whoa there... No need to be surly, now. Easy...easy... now GO!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gryphon-hit-2.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Mounted Dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Though they stink, gryphons are magnificent animals. They may not be able to navigate our twisted caverns very well, but if you ever see the surface again, they will dominate the skies. Best of luck, Allies-of-Knalga."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Gryphon Tender",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Who are these that approach? Surface-dwellers! On your guard, men!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Konrad",
            x: 12,
            y: 21,
            to_x: 11,
            to_y: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Delfador",
            x: 12,
            y: 23,
            to_x: 11,
            to_y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Kalenz",
            x: 14,
            y: 23,
            to_x: 13,
            to_y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We come in peace, friends. We come in peace!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Oh, do you? I see that you are accompanied by elves. Can we dwarves not live in peace without the treacherous elves coming to bother us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Why such harsh words, dwarf? Elves have never done you any harm."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("‘Never done us any harm?’ Why, I was there myself, when the elves refused to honor our alliance. Many dwarves were slaughtered, and you cowardly elves did nothing to help!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("You go too far! I am Kalenz, a mighty elvish lord! How dare such as you, sniveling in his tunnel, call me a coward?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Peace, friends! Peace! We must not fight among ourselves, for the evil orcs roam the lands above us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("Very well! Explain your presence here then, human. Who are you? Why have you risked life and limb to come to Knalga, home of the dwarves?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Well, we... we..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We have come so that an heir may claim his inheritance, that a king may claim his throne. We seek the Sceptre of Fire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("The Sceptre of Fire? Are you out of your minds? Surely you speak in jest!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We jest not, friend. We seek the Sceptre of Fire. We seek the help of the dwarves in finding it. But know that we will find it, whether you help us or not."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You speak foolishness. No one even knows if the Sceptre of Fire still exists. And who is this heir, this king that you speak of?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I am, sir."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You? Ha ha! This boy that stands before me is the King of Wesnoth? Ha ha! I haven’t had such a laugh in a long time. And who are you, old man?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I am Delfador, Delfador the Great, Arch Mage to King Garard, and Protector of his heir."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You... you are Delfador? I saw Delfador when I was but a young dwarf, and I will tell you, old man, you are not Delfador. Men! Take these liars out of my sight. Delfador perished many years ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "lightning.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 75,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("I am Delfador the Great! Tremble before my wrath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You... you really are Delfador! But we had news that you were dead, years ago!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("They thought I was dead. They hoped I was dead. Yet still I live."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("And you really think that you can find the Sceptre of Fire?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Yes, I do. If you help us, friend, all the treasures of Knalga that we find are yours. We want only the Sceptre. It will be dangerous. Make no mistake about that: dwarves will be killed, perhaps many dwarves. But surely it is better than hiding from the orcs like worms."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("You are right, friend. I will put my best men at your disposal, though we know naught of the Sceptre’s location. Legend says it is hidden in the eastern tunnels."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Then to the eastern tunnels we shall go!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
